Question: Show the filesystem usage and limit bytes for all containers of the auth service.

Metrics List:
- {"name": "container_memory_failcnt", "type": "counter", "description": "Number of memory usage hits limits"}
- {"name": "container_memory_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Current memory usage in bytes, including all memory regardless of when it was accessed"}
- {"name": "container_fs_limit_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes that can be consumed by the container on this filesystem."}
- {"name": "container_memory_max_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Maximum memory usage recorded in bytes"}
- {"name": "kube_pod_container_resource_limits", "type": "gauge", "description": "The number of requested limit resource by a container. It is recommended to use the kube_pod_resource_limits metric exposed by kube-scheduler instead, as it is more precise."}
- {"name": "container_fs_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes that are consumed by the container on this filesystem."}
- {"name": "container_cpu_usage_seconds_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Cumulative cpu time consumed in seconds."}
- {"name": "container_blkio_device_usage_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Blkio Device bytes usage"}
- {"name": "node_forks_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Total number of forks."}
- {"name": "node_disk_reads_merged_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The total number of reads merged."}
- {"name": "node_context_switches_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Total number of context switches."}
- {"name": "kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total", "type": "counter", "description": "[STABLE] The number of container restarts per container."}
- {"name": "node_disk_written_bytes_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The total number of bytes written successfully."}
- {"name": "node_disk_writes_completed_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The total number of writes completed successfully."}
- {"name": "node_disk_reads_completed_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The total number of reads completed successfully."}
- {"name": "node_disk_read_bytes_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The total number of bytes read successfully."}
- {"name": "container_memory_cache", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes of page cache memory."}
- {"name": "node_disk_write_time_seconds_total", "type": "counter", "description": "This is the total number of seconds spent by all writes."}
- {"name": "node_disk_read_time_seconds_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The total number of seconds spent by all reads."}
